{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16968","headline":"崔敷叹春物将谢恨不同览时余方爲事牵束及往寻不遇题之留赠 · 武元衡","name":"崔敷叹春物将谢恨不同览时余方爲事牵束及往寻不遇题之留赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九陌迟迟丽景斜，禁街西访隐沦赊。\n门依高柳空飞絮，身逐闲云不在家。\n轩冕强来趋世路，琴尊空负赏年华。\n残阳寂寞东城去，惆怅春风落尽花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}